※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4669
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4669 LANG_ITERATOR_NOT_AN_ARRAY

※ An iterator handed in is walked through a call per turn and says nothing about
※ how many turns there are, so no array can be built from it.

fn first(s: ⇉u8) → u8:
    let r: ⇉ = s
    r⟦0⟧

let std := ⎕import("std")

@[startup]
fn main(init: std.Init) → u6:
    0u6
